%---- Closed periodic box of static dusty gas and radiation, no sources: started from a snapshot (restart flag 2)
InitCondFile  rt_closed_box_ics
OutputDir     output
ICFormat      3
SnapFormat    3
RestartFile                 restart
SnapshotFileBase            snapshot
OutputListOn                0
OutputListFilename          output_times.txt
NumFilesPerSnapshot         1
NumFilesWrittenInParallel   1

%---- 64 steps of 3e-3 = TimeMax / 2^6, under the RT Courant step (0.4 x 0.25 pc / c_tilde = 3.3e-3); a snapshot every 8
TimeOfFirstSnapshot     0.0
TimeBetSnapshot         0.024
TimeBegin   0.0
TimeMax     0.192
MaxSizeTimestep         3.1e-3
MinSizeTimestep         1.0e-10

TimeLimitCPU            3600
CpuTimeBetRestartFile   7200

%---- System of units: pc, Msun, km/s
UnitLength_in_cm            3.085678e+18
UnitMass_in_g               1.989e+33
UnitVelocity_in_cm_per_s    1.00e+05
GravityConstantInternal     0

ComovingIntegrationOn   0
BoxSize                 8.0
Omega0                  0.
OmegaLambda             0.
OmegaBaryon             0.
HubbleParam             1.

MaxMemSize          4000
PartAllocFactor     5.0
BufferSize          200
TreeDomainUpdateFrequency   0.005

InitGasTemp     0
MinGasTemp      1
InitRadiationTemp   10

SofteningGas    1e-10
SofteningHalo   0.020
SofteningDisk   0.150
SofteningBulge  0.500
SofteningStars  0.01
SofteningBndry  0.01
SofteningGasMaxPhys     0.0005
SofteningHaloMaxPhys    0.010
SofteningDiskMaxPhys    0.075
SofteningBulgeMaxPhys   0.250
SofteningStarsMaxPhys   0.0005
SofteningBndryMaxPhys   0.0005

DesNumNgb               32
MaxKernelRadius         1.0e10
MinGasKernelRadiusFractional    0
